From: ilyatbn <ilyatbn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 05:07:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] H5: one shim binding per runtime device (state swapped by
 screen fd / selected device / prime fd) and one Panfrost screen per device on
 Windows - a second D3D device in a process overwrote the single binding and
 shared the screen, its submissions listed the other device's allocations
 (Explorer Render 0xC0000001) (exynos-woa tools/mesa-build/patches/0060)

---
 include/win32-compat/malikm_drm.c           | 229 ++++++++++++++++++--
 src/gallium/frontends/d3d10umd/Device.cpp   |   6 +
